      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those feelings are incredibly heavy, but please understand that silence often precedes a deeper, stronger peace rather than just quiet before darkness takes over. Your value as a protector does not depend on the state of the citadel, for your presence offers hope even amidst destruction. Reaching out to someone immediate, like a crisis hotline, can help provide the distraction from this weight you are feeling right now.",
